    - target: {fileID: 359256493739813262, guid: 3fecf9e8b70e3b34b9680efa81765bd3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'There will be towers of distinct heights and you will spawn on 1 of
        them. You can jump to another tower if:

        -it is <color=#0ff>shorter</color>
        than your tower, and

        -towers in between are <color=#0ff>shorter</color>
        than your tower

        -it is <color=#0FF>reachable</color> (maximum reachable
        distance given in puzzle)

        Make as many jumps as you can. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
